Runtime: no third-party code. All sound is synthesised with the browser's Web Audio API; there are no
sample files and no HRTF data sets in this repository. The panner uses the HRTF built into the browser.

Development tools only (not shipped): TypeScript, Vite, Vitest, Playwright and @types/node, each under its
own licence (see pnpm-lock.yaml).

The research notes in docs/research cite and briefly quote published works; those works keep their own
authors and licences. Measured HRTF sets named as a planned upgrade (SADIE II: Apache-2.0; HUTUBS:
CC BY 4.0) are not included.

Part of the ShramkoGSFPV browser FPV simulator: https://github.com/AndriiShramko/ShramkoGSFPV
